 "text": "Skip to main content\nStudent Ambassadors\nMicrosoft\nStudent Ambassadors\nBecome a Student Ambassador\nJoin a global community of students exploring what’s possible with Microsoft technology. Build practical skills and leadership experiences that help you move forward—creating opportunities aligned to what you care about most.\nGet Started\n\nStart something big\nThe future belongs to people who take the first step—and this is where you begin. Connect with peers, mentors, and Microsoft employees who help you grow faster, lead with confidence, and turn effort into results.\nGet started\nBecome a Student Ambassador\nFind Ambassadors\nSearch Student Ambassador profiles\nLearn more\nGet answers to frequent questions\nNavigate skilling\nGuidance for your AI-powered growth\nWhy you should join\nTake the lead and shape your future\nOpen to students from every background, with no application or gatekeeping—just jump in. Learn to lead with AI in ways that are creative and responsible, so you can think bigger, build faster, and bring bold ideas to life.\nGrow faster by growing together\nProgress hits different when you’re learning in a community with people who challenge and support you at every step. Friendships spark creativity, mentorship builds confidence, and growth is stronger when you’re not alone.\nTurn potential into proof positive\nSome milestones show where you’ve been, while others point to where you’re headed. Build a resume that reflects your strengths and contributions. Prove you’re not just ready for what’s next—you’re already doing it.\nWhat to expect\nLearn AI with purpose. Share your knowledge, lead with your peers, and build real experience that actually takes you somewhere—whether you’re focused on career paths or startup ideas.\nLearn more\nStudent Ambassador Milestones\nComplete activities to advance milestones and unlock benefits—share content and host events that help students skill on Microsoft technology.\nLearn more\nStudent resources\n